- Keyboard-accessible controls and visible focus states.
- Sufficient contrast and readable typography.
- Consistent spacing and alignment.
- No unnecessary animations, visual clutter, or excessive decorative cards.

Do not remove useful information or advanced capabilities in the name of simplicity. Make the interface easier to navigate while preserving the depth needed for a complete school-management system.

